Package: ParlAT
Type: Package
Title: A wrapper for the API of the Austrian Parliament
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Roland", "Schmidt", email = "rs2903@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: The ParlAT package wraps the API of the Austrian Parliament and seeks to provide an easy way for R users to access the available Open Data. 
    This includes, but is not limited to, data on past and current MPs, plenary sessions, or protocols.
